jd_text:
We are [REDACTED], a global Growth Invention company operating at the intersection of technology and marketing. We are looking for a Cloud Engineer to join our Experience & Engineering team in the Netherlands. You will build advanced cloud platforms for our clients and project teams, maintaining existing solutions in the smartest way possible. This role requires someone who can switch gears quickly and develop automatic workflows to accelerate team performance.

What You’ll Do
* Lead the infrastructure implementation/migration process from sprint 0 to go-live;
* Collaborate to support a smooth integration and long-term operational efficiency;
* Ensure best practices are established and deliver high quality work;
* Collaborate effectively with our clients teams, including developers questions, to facilitate cross-team communication and ensure a seamless transition;
* Troubleshoot and solve technical issues that may arise during the implementation/migration;

What You Bring
* Previous experience a Cloud Engineer (or similar role);
* Multi-cloud platform experience (Microsoft Azure, AWS and/or GCP);
* Experience with DevOps tooling for CI/CD, orchestration and monitoring like Azure DevOps, GitHub, Datadog, Cloudflare etc.;
* Understanding of Cloud Security & Networking;
* Experience with Infra-As-Code (i.e. Terraform);
* The ability & ambition to take ownership of your projects;
* Working proficiency of English;

WE OFFER
* A flexible, hybrid working policy (2-3 days from the office, depending on location) and the opportunity to work from abroad for 13 weeks a year;
* 24 vacation days per year and the possibility to buy an unlimited number of extra vacation days;
* [REDACTED] Learning Menu and [REDACTED] Special Programs. Develop your skills with courses and programs tailored to your needs;
* Stay happy and healthy with a contribution to your health through the OpenUp platform, gym and wellness discounts, and healthy lunches at the office;
* Get a discount on your lease bike and ride in style. You can also enjoy hassle free-commutes with an NS Business Card;
* Awesome clients. Whether big, small, local or global — at [REDACTED] you’ll get the opportunity to work with all of them. And we celebrate all of our successes together;

